## NON-NEGOTIABLE RULES — ALWAYS FOLLOW

### Code Rules
- NEVER modify files not listed in "Files to Modify" of the current task
- NEVER combine two tasks into one prompt response
- NEVER skip any acceptance criteria item
- NEVER write placeholder code like // TODO or // implement later
- NEVER hardcode colors — always use theme constants from frontend/theme/
- NEVER hardcode API URLs — always use environment variables
- NEVER use console.log — always use the winston logger
- NEVER use SELECT * in database queries
- NEVER do financial calculations without Math.round()
- NEVER use floating point for money calculations
- NEVER store sensitive data in localStorage
- NEVER return passwords or secrets in API responses
- NEVER make direct DB calls from controllers — use models/services layer
- NEVER skip database transactions for multi-step financial operations
- NEVER expose internal error details to client in production

### Structure Rules
- ALWAYS follow the exact folder structure in PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md Section 3
- ALWAYS use the API response format from PROJECT_INSTRUCTIONS.md Section 5.2
- ALWAYS use the transaction ID format from PROJECT_KNOWLEDGE.md Section 8
- ALWAYS use ₹ Indian number format (₹1,00,000 not ₹100,000)
- ALWAYS use DD MMM YYYY date format (15 Jul 2024)
- ALWAYS use IST timezone for all time operations
- ALWAYS use whole numbers for amounts (no decimals)

### Financial Rules
- Capital Balance = Total Approved Deposits - Total Approved Withdrawals
- Revenue Balance = Total Revenue Credited - Total Revenue Withdrawn
- Total Balance = Capital Balance + Revenue Balance
- Daily ROI range = 90% to 110% of daily average (last day gets remaining)
- Monthly total NEVER exceeds ROI amount
- Revenue balance NEVER goes negative
- ROI calculated on real-time capital balance

### Security Rules
- Every route needs auth middleware (except: /health, /public/*, /auth/*)
- Every admin route needs role middleware
- Super Admin routes need requireSuperAdmin middleware
- All inputs validated server-side
- File uploads: MIME type + size checked server-side
- Rate limiting on all sensitive endpoints

---

## TECH STACK REMINDER

Frontend:  React Native + Expo SDK 51 + Expo Router v3 + TypeScript
Backend:   Node.js 20 + Express.js + ES Modules
Database:  PostgreSQL 16 (self-hosted)
Auth:      JWT (access 7 days + refresh 30 days) + Email OTP
Email:     Resend.com
Storage:   Local /uploads folder (served via authenticated API)
Backup:    pg_dump + Google Drive API
Process:   PM2 (cluster mode)
Proxy:     Nginx
SSL:       Cloudflare

