## THEME COLORS — NEVER USE HARDCODED COLORS

Primary (Dark Blue):   #0A1628
Secondary (Golden):    #C9A84C
Background (White):    #FFFFFF
Surface:               #F8F9FA
Error (Red):           #EF4444
Success (Green):       #10B981
Warning (Amber):       #F59E0B
Text Primary:          #0A1628
Text Secondary:        #6B7280
Border:                #E5E7EB

Dark Mode Background:  #0A1628
Dark Mode Surface:     #1E2D45
Dark Mode Card:        #1E2D45

---

## TRANSACTION ID FORMAT

Capital Deposit:    TKT-CAP-DEP-YYYY-XXXXX
Capital Withdrawal: TKT-CAP-WDR-YYYY-XXXXX
Revenue Credit:     TKT-REV-CR-YYYY-XXXXX
Revenue Withdrawal: TKT-REV-WDR-YYYY-XXXXX
Admin Manual Entry: TKT-ADM-YYYY-XXXXX
Support Ticket:     TKT-SUP-YYYY-XXXXX
Profile Request:    TKT-PRF-YYYY-XXXXX

---

## STATUS COLORS — ALWAYS USE THESE

Pending / Submitted / Under Review → #F59E0B (Amber)
Approved / Active / Verified       → #10B981 (Green)
Rejected / Failed / Locked         → #EF4444 (Red)
Completed / Processed              → #3B82F6 (Blue)
Cancelled                          → #6B7280 (Grey)

---

## API RESPONSE FORMAT — ALWAYS USE THIS

Success:
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Operation successful",
  "data": { ... }
}

Error:
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Error description",
  "error": "ERROR_CODE"
}

