## HOW TO USE THIS PROJECT

The user will give you task numbers like "Complete Task 1.1" or "Do Task 2.3".

When a task number is given:
1. Open PROJECT_PHASES.md
2. Find that exact task
3. Read it completely
4. Implement it exactly as written
5. Do nothing more, nothing less

If the user says "next task" — find the next uncompleted task in PROJECT_PHASES.md and complete it.

If the user says "what task are we on" — check PROJECT_PHASES.md task tracker and report current status.

---

## IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULES SUMMARY

1. Investor = "Tikhat Partner" (use this term in all UI)
2. Admin approval required for: registration, capital deposits, profile updates, KYC, withdrawals
3. Super Admin exclusive: create/delete/suspend admins, approve backdate entries, system settings, resolve 7+ day tickets
4. Capital locked → pending withdrawals auto-cancelled
5. Revenue credit paused → revenue NOT redistributed (lost for paused days)
6. UPI transfer limit: ₹1,00,000 maximum
7. Minimum capital: ₹10,000 | Maximum capital: ₹10,00,000
8. Minimum withdrawal: ₹1,000
9. OTP expiry: 10 minutes
10. Failed login attempts: 5 → lock, auto-unlock at 12 AM IST
11. Sessions: 1 mobile + 1 web simultaneously
12. Duplicate PAN, Aadhar, UTR, Email → globally blocked
13. All transactions get IDs — even rejected and cancelled ones
14. Audit trail: permanent (5+ years)
15. Backup: daily at 12 AM IST → local + Google Drive

